# WinPE OpenSSH sshd 配置 v4 (公钥登录)
Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey X:\OpenSSH\ssh_host_rsa_key
HostKey X:\OpenSSH\ssh_host_ecdsa_key
HostKey X:\OpenSSH\ssh_host_ed25519_key
AuthorizedKeysFile X:\OpenSSH\administrators_authorized_keys
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
StrictModes no
LogLevel VERBOSE
Subsystem sftp X:\OpenSSH\sftp-server.exe
